# These recordings are compared byte for byte against the generator in
# `transcribe::fixture_pcm`, so every byte of them must survive a checkout
# unchanged. `-text` tells git to do no end-of-line conversion in either
# direction, as `data/**` does for the signed dataset: a platform that
# rewrites line endings (Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true)
# would otherwise turn a sample that happens to be 0x0D 0x0A into a fixture
# the stub transcriber no longer recognises.
*.pcm -text
